SpatialValidator ..> SpatialMonad : evaluates
SpatialMonad --> SpatialValidationRecord : persists state
SpatialValidationRecord "1" -- "0..*" SpatialMonadStock : allocates trophic stock
SpatialValidationRecord "1" -- "1" SpatialBlockchainLedger : secures via hash

